line 13, 14, 15, 17, 18, 19, 20 extra: bug SUB-1206 indexing, destructuring and `for-of` reject a union of arrays, tuples or strings
line 6 type: bug SUB-1196 (literal under an expected type) a literal checked against an expected type takes that type, where tsc keeps its own
line 26 type: by-design spec §1.6 `&&` keeps `number` and `boolean` whole in its falsy part, where tsc narrows to `0` or `false`
